            "review_title": "Review at Santo Beer Collection - Craft Beer Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "viet1\nNha Trang, Vietnam10442 contributions\n1\nWow, so many beers\nFeb 2022\nHave never seen a place in Vietnam with so many beers. 19 on tap ! Possibly a bit pricey but worth a try. Staff very friendly and helpful. Many bottled and canned beers from all over the world. Good choice of Vietnamese craft beers served cold. House peanuts are very good. Enjoyed the place and the atmosphere. Have already been back twice.\nWritten February 25, 2022",
